{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "358ed601-17c3-88fb-b7d0-5cc992e24c3b",
  "created_at": "2026-01-12T11:43:14-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Holly Hazard",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:40:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, Greg speaking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:40:38-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, so the old fence is completely rotted out, the posts are just gone at the bottom, and I want to put the new one right where it is now. Same spot, same line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:40:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sorry, you're on speaker, I'm getting a little echo. Who am I speaking with, and where's the property?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:40:59-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, sorry. Holly Hazard. It's 265 Bliss Road, over on the Easton's Beach side. The storm Saturday didn't help the fence any, but it was already falling apart before that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:41:11-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 265 Bliss. So you're tearing out the old fence and putting up a new one in the same location."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:41:19-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. And I'm going with composite, four feet tall. So my question is do I need a permit for a fence, or since it's just a replacement, am I fine?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:41:30-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In general, a fence needs a permit, and replacing one can still count. Height and location matter, and being near the beach can add some wrinkles. Let me pull up the property so I can see if there's anything on your lot. Hold please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:41:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, sure, yes, I'd appreciate the help. Um, what do you need from me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:41:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I said hold please. Just give me a moment to look at the file."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:41:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh! Hold. Sorry, I thought you were offering to help. Okay, I'll hold."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:42:04-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:42:06-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:42:07-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thanks for waiting. So yes, you'll want to apply for a fence permit even though it's replacing what's there. You'd send in a simple application with a sketch of where it goes, the height, and the material. Composite at four feet is pretty ordinary."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:42:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And how long does it take to get approved? I'd like to get the contractor scheduled."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:42:31-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For a straightforward fence it's usually pretty quick, often within a week or so if the paperwork's complete. I can't promise a day, but don't schedule the install until you have the approval in hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:42:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, so wait for the approval first. Where do I get the application?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:42:50-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's on the city website under zoning and inspections, or you can stop by the office here at City Hall and pick one up. Drop it off with the sketch when it's filled out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:43:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll stop by this week. That's all I needed. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:43:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Hazard. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T11:43:12-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
